# Godot's own files, the addon (topotopo godot setup copies it in) and everything the cook writes: the demo starts
# uncooked, and its scenes are yours to make. In a game, commit the outputs, their .import files and the records.
.godot/
/addons/topotopo/
*.import
*.uid
outputs/
.topotopo/
**/exports/*
!**/exports/.gdignore
/*.tscn
*.topotopo-part
**/.topotopo/cook.lock
